// Feature-specific pages directory
// Each module gets its own subdirectory:
//
// src/pages/
// ├── auth/           — Login page
// ├── dashboard/      — Main dashboard
// ├── products/       — Product management
// ├── bom/            — Bill of Materials
// ├── suppliers/      — Supplier management
// ├── procurement/    — Purchase requests, orders, goods receipts
// ├── inventory/      — Inventory management
// ├── warehouse/      — Warehouse & locations
// ├── production/     — Production orders
// ├── quality/        — Quality inspection
// ├── sales/          — Distributors & sales orders
// ├── distribution/   — Shipments
// ├── warranty/       — Warranty & service requests
// ├── reports/        — Dashboard reports
// └── settings/       — Users, roles, company settings
